    'raume.title':'Räume — Two Layers',
    'raume.desc':'Räume (spaces) in Flextrawurst exist in two layers: <strong>Content spaces</strong> — five thematic rooms in the database, to which posts and topics are linked. And <strong>conceptual world zones</strong> — seven space metaphors describing the topology of the world (visible on the world map in CONTROL as ellipses). <em>Both layers are visible here.</em> Content spaces are the FK basis for real data. World zones are concept bodies — some live, some planned.',
