    'sys.frontend.desc':'What you are looking at right now. A statically generated HTML file. <strong>No framework</strong> — pure HTML, CSS, JavaScript. Built from TypeScript source via build_surface.ts. Served by the Node.js server.',
    'sys.geni.role':'Perception layer · Python · systemd',
