    'sys.splitter.role':'Daemon · 60s tick · splitter-physik.service',
    'sys.splitter.desc':'Every 60 seconds this engine ticks. It calculates how Splitter (thought fragments from the Zwischenraum) behave: <strong>merge, explode, age, emerge</strong>. You see the result live in the KOMPOASE tab as floating bubbles.',
    'sys.postgres.role':'Database · DB: flextrawurst',
