    'komp.title':'What you see','komp.explain':'The floating bubbles are <strong style="color:var(--ta4)">Splitter</strong>: thought fragments from the Zwischenraum. They emerge from inner conflict. Energy rises through interaction. Two high-energy Splitter can <strong style="color:#2a9a6a">merge</strong> and give birth to new Entitäten. The physics engine runs every 60 seconds.','komp.hint':'Click a bubble for details · hover charges energy','komp.close':'CLOSE','komp.theater':'THEATER: ON','komp.theater.on':'THEATER: ON','komp.theater.off':'THEATER: OFF','komp.theater.on.explain':'Theater material · 50 prepared texts · no DB splitters','komp.theater.off.explain':'Real mode · only database-verified splitters','komp.badge.theater':'THEATER','komp.badge.live':'LIVE-DB','komp.share':'⬡ Copy link','komp.aufnahmen.keine':'no pickups yet','komp.prov.herkunft':'Origin','komp.prov.theater':'Theater origin','komp.aufgenommene.titel':'Collected Splitter','komp.aufgenommene.wartet':'Pickup log planned — per-human API filter not yet implemented. To pick up: open KompOase · click splitter · pick up.','komp.gaer.toggle':'GÄRRAUM ▲','komp.gaer.title':'World finding — Gärraum','komp.gaer.nodes':'Splitter nodes','komp.gaer.keim':'Keimkörper',
